  "description": "Saddle up for a design adventure with Western, a rugged display typeface that captures a “frontier-and-vintage” soul. This font features classic, heavy slab-serif letterforms characterized by rhythmic “spur” accents and dramatic, lasso-inspired swashes that command attention. With its bold architectural weight and authentic cowboy charm, Western is the premier choice for independent steakhouse branding, frontier-themed apparel logos, rodeo event posters, and high-impact “outlaw-and-heritage” social media headers.",
